description	"Shadow Trooper

Ghost Infantry utilizing active camouflage and squad tactics.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- SE-14C Infiltrator Pistol (3)
-- 80% Slower RoF
-- 20% More Damage/FP Drain
-- 10% More Velocity
-- Cripples On Hit
- Class-C Sonic Detonator (1)
-- Concussion Grenade, Applies Sonic On Hit
- Class-O Particulate Canister (2)
-- Frag Grenade
-- Emits Smoke Screen On Detonation

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Assemble (3)
- Dexterity (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Cloaking Device (2)
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Sprint (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]
- Grapple Hook (1) ^3[CS4]"
